	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"ガンプラの楽しさを伝える『ガンプラくん』から「シャアザクくん」が登場！",
			"選択式でランナーVer.でもディスプレイが可能！おなじみの装備も付属。",
			"• シャアザクくんの通常Ver.とランナーVer.を選択式でディスプレイ。",
			"• お馴染みの装備「ヒート・ホーク」「ザク・マシンガン」「ザク・バズーカ」も付属。",
			"• モノアイは左右に可動。",
			"• 別売りの「ガンプラくん」シリーズプラモデルを揃えて劇中をイメージしたディスプレイをしよう！"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Char's Zaku-kun\" appears from \"Gunpla-kun\" which conveys the fun of Gunpla!",
			"You can also display it in RunnerVer. by selecting it! Familiar equipment is also included.",
			"• Char's Zaku-kun's normal version and Runner version are displayed in a selection format.",
			"• Familiar equipment \"Heat Hawk\", \"Zaku Machine Gun\", and \"Zaku Bazooka\" are also included.",
			"• Monoeye can move left and right.",
			"• Create a display inspired by the movie by arranging the \"Gunpla-kun\" series plastic models (sold separately)!"
		]
	},
